  "dtcClearDialogBody": "This erases stored and pending fault codes and turns the fault lamp off, and it also resets emissions readiness — the vehicle has to complete a full round of self-diagnosis again before it can pass an inspection. Permanent fault codes (Mode 0A) cannot be cleared.",
